<title>JAPAN: Nihon Spindle shares up on air filters.</title>
<headline>Nihon Spindle shares up on air filters.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Nihon Spindle Mfg Co Ltd surged on Wednesday due to hopes that filters manufactured by the firm, which are designed to remove toxic gases from the air, will help boost its earnings, traders said.</p>
<p>At 0541 GMT, the share price was up 55 yen at 360, making it the second largest gainer on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange. Turnover was 164,000 shares.</p>
